{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104084056720-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104100457\"/><p>麗都灣泳灘。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月4日）宣布，荃灣區的麗都灣泳灘及更生灣泳灘將於上午9時至下午3時檢查防鯊網及浮台，期間泳灘將暫停開放，市民請勿在該2處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T02:24:54.651531+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T00:40:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:45.342980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:40.482160+00:00","content_hash":"27de6e6a955c7c19c021959eab67d95237fc712eb7f453afeac383e0f630a3a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}